3314-203476d5-6a53-4daa-887a-3d3e4289e828"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Recovery preflight for group04 Gerrit push rejection (missing blob 490430b52a0e274b2d9b73fb3aba1918b107543a): completed EBS snapshot snap-0e1b216cb163b9ef9 of Gerrit volume vol-06fa2e77a9dd97527 before any repair. Host Git as ec2-user reads the named blob (type blob, size 10319); full fsck --full --connectivity-only --no-dangling --strict exited 0. Gerrit SSH replication start --all --wait succeeded. python -m rebar.mirror_guard --replication --merged-reachability --merged-limit 50 exited 0: Gerrit and GitHub main both 7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c, all 50 recent merged revisions reachable. No live object-store mutation or Gerrit restart was performed. Authorized 1 exact push retry for group04; if it fails again, stop for diagnosis.","timestamp":1792744646900925621},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"The single authorized retry succeeded: group04 commit 83129b25017591d11c666463ee702ce73e2fbf5b was accepted as Gerrit change 3071 patchset 1. Gerrit reports NEW, 0 unresolved; CI run 39925960329 started. The named object is readable and full fsck, replication, and 50-merged-revision reachability all passed. Underlying cause of the original receive rejection remains unproven; no object-store repair or restart was performed. Tracking final CI/submit outcome before bug disposition.","timestamp":1792744729598533314}],"created_at":1792744003562274457,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9f6665f5-5950-4fa9-a2f3-0f5defc8037c","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8ca0-b4d6-f7dc-4e68"}],"description":"## Observation\nA push of group04 comment-remediation commit 83129b25017591d11c666463ee702ce73e2fbf5b to `gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main` was rejected before a Gerrit change was created: `remote unpack failed: error Missing blob 490430b52a0e274b2d9b73fb3aba1918b107543a`. The blob exists locally (`git cat-file -t` returns `blob`), and Gerrit and GitHub both advertise main at 7840899ea7ac0609bf3e0dec5e26effdbda1ec6c. The local full `make verify` passed before the push. No push retry has been made.\n\n## Recovery plan\nFollow `infra/runbooks/gerrit-object-store-repair.md`: inspect the live data volume, take an EBS snapshot before touching Gerrit's repository, record live main SHAs, validate quarantine refspecs, import missing objects from the GitHub mirror as Gerrit's uid, check the named blob and full object connectivity, verify replication and merged-change reachability, remove recovery refs, then retry the blocked review push once. Do not restart Gerrit or move live heads as part of this repair.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- Given the pre-repair Gerrit volume snapshot and recorded main SHAs, when recovery runs, then the missing blob is readable on Gerrit and live `refs/heads/main` does not move backward.\n- Given the repaired store, when full `git fsck --connectivity-only --no-dangling --strict`, replication, and merged-reachability checks run, then all pass.\n- Given those checks pass, when the blocked commit is pushed once to `refs/for/main`, then Gerrit accepts a change for the exact revision and its ordinary review/CI gates can run.\n- Record the recovery evidence and push result on this ticket.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["gerrit","infrastructure","delivery-blocker"],"ticket_id":"794d-b458-5d78-42c4","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Repair Gerrit missing blob blocking comment-remediation review upload","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["06251806-0869-44cc-9cd9-3e9edbcd1da9","9f6665f5-5950-4fa9-a2f3-0f5defc8037c","17a169cd-ad95-48a8-8236-6f9a022cb0b7","203476d5-6a53-4daa-887a-3d3e4289e828"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1792750441501682453,"uuid":"41cde8a4-621a-4a31-8da8-bfedf504ba66"}